          "what": "The camera is the T-3040 initial landmark fit, reused here unchanged so that the before and after differ only by the blockhouse's bytes. It reached its imposed 100 m eye bound and renders the whole compound aerial and undersized against a nearly level printed view; both stockade endpoints are cropped. It is marked diagnostic_only and is not an accepted historical viewing position. Scale, height and framing still want fitting before anything here is judged pixel for pixel. Nothing was moved to fit it.",
