        },
        {
          "row": 2,
          "what": "The print shows a galleried range; the corresponding range identity, its galleries, facade openings, roof forms and the other buildings' chimney counts are unresolved. Surveyed placements are not moved to fit a compressed retrospective composition.",
          "status": "open"
        },
        {
          "row": 3,
          "what": "The compound's composition as a whole \u2014 the relative sizes and spacing the print draws \u2014 differs from the committed survey, and the other dated pictures of the fort listed on T-2388 have not been read against it at all.",
